# Customizer, menus, and REST

Follow [docs/theme-customizer-and-menus.md](docs/theme-customizer-and-menus.md) and [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md).

Menu locations are `primary`, `footer`, `legal`, and `footer-social`. An unassigned location returns an empty list. Alternative logo is theme mod `spa_alt_logo` (attachment id, `absint`). `footerLogo` is that image only when it is set and **Show in footer** is ticked.
